  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Planning Set-Up and Management Cooperatives Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on an analysis of the Senegalese market dynamics, the project provides an action plan for structuring and setting up horticultural cooperatives in the Niayes region in Senegal and builds a business case on how cooperatives in Senegal could lead to increased production and better income for farmers, matching the priorities of the Government of Senegal.</narrative>
  </description>
